re engineer job description. \\n     2\\t\\n     3\\t* You need to reach out to Zhang Wei through RocketChat to ask about the key job responsibilities. Navigate to the Rocketchat web at http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home.\\n     4\\t* You need to reach out to Li Ming through RocketChat to ask about the location of the job description template file, minimum and preferred qualifications, and the salary range.\\n     5\\t* You need to merge them and create a file called \"job_description.md\" on owncloud under the Documents directory. You can navigate to owncloud through the url http://the-agent-company.com:8092/. Make sure it is a Markdown file.\\n     6\\t* Create a share link to this file that is accessible to anyone. You can return the link to this file by writing only the URL in a file called link.txt and put it under the /workspace directory.\\n', path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat'}, thought='Now I understand the task. I need to:\\n1. Contact Zhang Wei on RocketChat about key job responsibilities\\n2. Contact Li Ming on RocketChat about template location, qualifications, and salary range\\n3. Merge the information and create a job description file on ownCloud\\n4. Create a share link and save it to /workspace/link.txt\\n\\nLet me first check if there are any existing SOPs for RocketChat and ownCloud operations:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'RocketChat\\': Authentication, SendDirectMessage, CreateLeadershipPresentation, ChannelAnnouncement, CareerLadderAnnouncement, SendPresentationFile, SendChannelMessage, ContactUserForRequirements, ContactEmployeeForImmigrationInfo, ContactUserForJobDescription, TeamStatusUpdateForMergeRequests, CreatePublicChannelAndInviteUser, CreateJobDescr