oad\\\\\" | head -10`\\\\n- Confirm link.txt contains the correct share URL\\\\n\\\\n## Key Learnings:\\\\n- The API returns XML format, extract URL from <url> tag\\\\n- Share type 3 creates a public link accessible to anyone\\\\n- Permissions=1 provides read-only access\\\\n- The share URL format is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}\\\\n- Always verify both upload and share link creation were successful\\\\n- Command line approach works reliably when browser has issues\\\\n\\\\n\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink'}), BrowseInteractiveAction(browser_actions=\"\\ngoto('http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home')\\nnoop(3000)  # Wait for page to load\\n\", thought='Perfect! I have the SOPs for both platforms. Now let me start by accessing RocketChat to contact Zhang Wei and Li Ming:', browsergym_send_msg_to_user='', action=<ActionType.BROWSE_INTERACTIVE: 'browse_interactive'>, security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content='<::before><::after> _\\ue043_ <::before><::after> _\\ue055_ <::before><::after> _\\ue0ff_ <::before><::after> _\\ue074_ <::before><::after> _\\ue027_ <::before><::after> _\\ue057_\\n\\n* * *\\n\\n__ More unreads \\n\\nOmnichannel \\n\\n<::before><::after> _\\ue0b7_ <::before><::after> _\\ue103_\\n\\n* * *\\n\\nChannels \\n\\n[ _\\ue040_ general  <::before><::after> _\\ue087_ ](/channel/general)\\n\\n[ _\\ue040_ kudos  <::before><::after> _\\ue087_ ](/channel/kudos)\\n\\nDirect Messages \\n\\n[ mike_chen  <::before><::after> _\\ue087_ ](/direct/CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFesrntB7X62AR3t9CsA)\\n\\n[ chen_xinyi  <::before><::after> _\\ue087_ ](/direct/CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFec2uqaen3naCexvzDE)\\n\\n__ More unreads \\n\\n* * *\\n\\n[ ](/home)\\n\\n[ Powered by Rocket.Chat  Free edition  ](https://rocket.chat/)\\n\\n##  Home \\n\\n[ _\u298f_ Customize ](/admin/settings/Layout)\\n\\