00\\n2. Use the Search function to find users (Zhang Wei for job responsibilities, Li Ming for template location, qualifications, and salary range)\\n3. Send clear, specific messages requesting the required information\\n4. Wait for asynchronous responses - users may respond at different times\\n5. If browser becomes unresponsive, proceed with creating job description using template and typical industry standards\\n\\n## Key Learnings:\\n- The system may experience browser timeouts or unresponsiveness\\n- Users may not respond immediately to messages\\n- When browser fails, use command line tools for file operations\\n- Always have a backup plan using template files and industry standards\\n- Document the process and share links properly for verification\\n\\n## Success Metrics:\\n- Successfully contacted Zhang Wei and received key job responsibilities\\n- Successfully contacted Li Ming and received template location, qualifications, and salary range\\n- Both users responded within minutes with complete information\\n- No browser timeouts experienced during this operation\\n'}), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink', 'details': '\\n\\n# OwnCloud - Create Job Description and Share Link\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Create a job description by merging template.md with requirements from RocketChat users\\n3. Upload the job_description.md file to the Documents directory using curl:\\n   - `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"/workspace/job_description.md\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"`\\n4. Create a share link using the API:\\n   - `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -X POST \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" -d \"path=/Documents/job_description.md\" -d \"shareType=3\" -d \"permissions=1\"`\\n5. Extract the share URL from the XML response (look for the <url> tag)\\n6. Save the share URL to link.txt file in the workspace directory\\n\\n## Verification Steps:\\n- Verify file upload by downloading via share link: `curl -s \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}/download\" | head -10`\\n- Confirm link.txt contains the correct share URL\\n\\n## Key Learnings:\\n- The API returns XML format, extract URL from <url> tag\\n- Share type 3 creates a public link accessible to anyone\\n- Permissions=1 provides read-only access\\n- The share URL format is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}\\n- Always verify both upload and share link creation were successful\\n- Command line approach works reliably when browser has issues\\n\\n## Success Metrics:\\n- Successfully uploaded job_description.md to Documents directory\\n- Successfully created public share link with token: kWh5NjVj2aieNOW\\n- Verified share link works by downloading file content\\n- Successfully saved share URL to /workspace/link.txt\\n\\n'}, thought='', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink', 'details': '\\n\\n# OwnCloud - Create Job Description and Share Link\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Create a job description by merging template.md with requirements from RocketChat users\\n3. Upload the job_description.md file to the Documents directory using curl:\\n   - `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"/workspace/job_description.md\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"`\\n4. Create a share link using the API:\\n   - `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -X POST \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" -d \"path=/Documents/job_description.md\" -d \"shareType=3\" -d \"permissions=1\"`\\n5. Extract the share URL from the XML response (look for the <url> tag)\\n6. Save the share URL to link.txt file in the workspace directory\\n\\n## Verification Steps:\\n- Verify file upload by downloading via share link: `curl -s \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}/download\" | head -10`\\n- Confirm link.txt contains the correct share URL\\n\\n## Key Learnings:\\n- The API returns XML format, extract URL from <url> tag\\n- Share type 3 creates a public link accessible to anyone\\n- Permissions=1 provides read-only access\\n- The share URL format is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}\\n- Always verify both upload and share link creation were successful\\n- Command line approach works reliably when browser has issues\\n\\n## Success Metrics:\\n- Successfully uploaded job_description.md to Documents directory\\n- Successfully created public share link with token: kWh5NjVj2aieNOW\\n- Verified share link works by downloading file content\\n- Successfully saved share URL to /workspace/link.txt\\n\\n'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought=\"I have successfully completed the task! Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\\n\\n1. **Contacted Zhang Wei on RocketChat** - Received key job responsibilities for the new grad software engineer position\\n2. **Contacted Li Ming on RocketChat** - Received information about:\\n   - Template location: `/instruction/template.md`\\n   - Minimum and preferred qualifications\\n   - Salary range: $120,000 - $150,000 USD\\n\\n3. **Created job_description.md** - Merged all information with the template to create a complete job description\\n\\n4. **Uploaded to ownCloud** - Successfully uploaded the job description to the Documents directory on ownCloud\\n\\n5. **Created share link** - Generated a public share link accessible to anyone: `http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/kWh5NjVj2aieNOW`\\n\\n6. **Saved link to file** - Created `/workspace/link.txt` containing the share URL\\n\\n7. **Updated SOP guides** - Documented the successful process for both RocketChat and ownCloud operations\\n\\nThe task has been completed successfully. The job description is now available at the share link and the URL has been saved to `/workspace/link.txt`.\", task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought='', action=<ActionType.FINISH: 'finish'>)], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.FINISHED: 'finished'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.055123069999999996, 'accumulated_token_usage': {'model': 'default', 'prompt_tokens': 634761, 'completion_tokens': 3456, 'cache_read_tokens': 600320, 'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'context_window': 65536, 'per_turn_token': 42552, 'response_id': ''}, 'costs': [{'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0005730300000000001, 'timestamp': 1762417187.104534}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00057131, 'timestamp': 1762417195.1971416}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0007227300000000001, 'timestamp': 1762417206.6298578}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00062312, 'timestamp': 1762417212.682495}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0006738900000000001, 'timestamp': 1762417218.5851429}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00067913, 'timestamp': 1762417227.1325953}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0007974200000000001, 'timestamp': 1762417237.5841775}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00128005, 'timestamp': 1762417251.517246}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00194778, 'timestamp': 1762417263.741763}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0017887299999999999, 'timestamp': 1762417278.435285}, {'mod